# @slock-ai/daemon — Agent runtime process
# The daemon uses CLI arguments, not environment variables.
#
# Usage:
#   npx @slock-ai/daemon --server-url <url> --api-key <sk_machine_xxx>
#
# --server-url  Backend API URL (e.g. http://localhost:3001 or https://api.slock.ai)
# --api-key     Machine API key generated in the Slock web UI (starts with sk_machine_)
